Every clinician should avoid an abrupt-opioid-discontinuation.
If a patient receives a high-dosage-opioid then every clinician should avoid an abrupt-opioid-discontinuation for the patient.
Every clinician should avoid a patient-dismissal-from-care.
If a patient has a pain then every clinician should ensure an appropriate-care for the patient.
If a patient has an opioid-use-complication then every clinician should ensure an appropriate-care for the patient.
